@startuml
title T12-WF15 — AI Account Management Agent (Sequence)
autonumber
participant "Schedule Trigger" as SCHED
participant "n8n WF15\nAccount Management" as N8N
participant "NestJS Backend" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Account Health Policy\ninside NestJS" as HEALTH
participant "Gemini API" as AI
participant "NestJS CustomerTask API" as CTASK

SCHED -> N8N: Weekly strategic-account review
activate N8N
N8N -> API: GET accounts explicitly marked STRATEGIC
API -> DB: Query authorized strategic customers
DB --> API: Strategic customer IDs
API --> N8N: Account cohort
loop For each account
N8N -> API: GET account profile, interactions, follow-ups, feedback, renewals
API -> DB: Read available account/CRM data
DB --> API: Current facts + data coverage
API --> N8N: Account evidence
N8N -> API: POST calculate health
API -> HEALTH: Calculate versioned deterministic score
HEALTH --> API: Score or INSUFFICIENT_DATA + component evidence
API --> N8N: Canonical health result
N8N -> AI: Explain risks/opportunities using score and evidence
AI --> N8N: Evidence-grounded account review
N8N -> N8N: Validate action allowlist and evidence references
N8N -> API: Save account review/health snapshot
API -> DB: Persist snapshot/history
DB --> API: snapshotId
API --> N8N: Saved snapshot
alt Critical risk/opportunity and action is warranted
N8N -> CTASK: POST /api/v1/customer-tasks with customerId + healthAssessmentId + dedupe key (canonical)
CTASK -> DB: Insert/reuse customer_tasks and audit entry
DB --> CTASK: Task ID/status
CTASK --> N8N: Created/already exists (idempotent)
else No escalation or insufficient evidence
N8N -> N8N: Retain snapshot; do not invent a score/action
end
end
deactivate N8N
note over API,HEALTH
Strategic status is explicitly marked by an authorized user. Approved v1 health
weights: engagement 30%, feedback 25%, open issues 25%, follow-up completion 20%.
Missing critical data yields INSUFFICIENT_DATA, not an invented zero score. `CustomerTask` is the operational task for account follow-up, distinct from `ReviewTask`.
end note
@enduml
